{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36351","headline":"赠赵崇侍御 · 方干","name":"赠赵崇侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贵达合逢明圣日，风流又及少年时。\n才因出衆人皆嫉，势欲摩霄自不知。\n正直早年闻苦节，从容此日见清规。\n却教鹦鹉呼桃叶，便遣婵娟唱竹枝。\n闲话篇章停烛久，醉迷歌舞出花迟。\n云鸿别有回翔便，应笑啁啾燕雀卑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}